{"availability":"available","full":"fastwithkamran/Opportune","name":"Opportune","description":"Opportune is a centralized social feed and community platform designed for students to discover academic and career opportunities, including hackathons, scholarships, internships, and events. Students can follow trusted universities, organizations, and communities to receive personalized updates and leverage an AI assistant for searching.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-23T17:40:01Z","updated":"2026-10-10T10:32:04Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://opportune-pk.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:ugcPost:7455169552008593409/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T11:06:43.585Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T11:06:43.585Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T11:06:43.585Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T11:06:43.585Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Opportune is a student opportunity discovery platform built for Pakistan and global learners.","It is designed to solve a real problem: students are currently forced to rely on random WhatsApp groups, scattered LinkedIn posts, emails, and social media pages to find hackathons, scholarships, internships, competitions, events, and announcements. At the same time, organizations struggle to market opportunities in one trusted place.","Opportune brings all of that into a single platform so students can discover what matters, follow organizations, and never miss an opportunity again."],"features":["what is happening now","what is relevant to their field or interest","which organizations are active and trustworthy"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/fastwithkamran/Opportune/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"f31b0755a748c5e4b342913735d6308b9b06f2e77e8e920588469775b713c447","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T11:06:43.658Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T11:06:43.658Z","proje